WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.908
Tina: Help me, you guys.

2
00:00:16.909 --> 00:00:19.885
Brad: I don’t think this is going to work.

3
00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.303
Danny: This net won’t break!

4
00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:29.564
Tina: Just . . . have . . . to . . . try . . . harder!

5
00:00:29.565 --> 00:00:32.694
Danny: We’re caught, and Bello too!

6
00:00:32.695 --> 00:00:36.689
Tina: Hopian will be upset because Bello is in danger.

7
00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:40.816
Brad: I’m upset that we’re in danger!

8
00:00:40.817 --> 00:00:45.546
Tina: Oh no! They’re taking us somewhere.

9
00:00:45.547 --> 00:00:46.989
Danny: Where?

10
00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:50.465
Tina: I don’t know─away from here.

11
00:00:50.466 --> 00:00:53.135
Brad: To Tristay, no doubt.

12
00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:59.100
Danny: This isn’t good.

13
00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:02.424
Tina: What do you think Tristay will do to us?

14
00:01:02.425 --> 00:01:06.060
Danny: Nothing good, that’s for sure!

15
00:01:06.061 --> 00:01:10.744
Brad: I think . . . I think we’re going up into the air.

16
00:01:10.745 --> 00:01:15.488
Danny: Look!

17
00:01:15.489 --> 00:01:19.599
Danny: I don’t think we should try escaping now.

18
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.480
Brad: They’re carrying us very high.

19
00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:31.632
Danny: There’s the mountaintop that Hopian described.

20
00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:38.169
Tina: Ouch!

21
00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:44.062
Tristay: Well, well, well. What do we have here?

22
00:01:44.063 --> 00:01:47.433
Danny: Big trouble for you!

23
00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:49.691
Tristay: I don’t think so.

24
00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:54.692
I have powers that will astonish you.

25
00:01:54.693 --> 00:01:56.847
Danny: You’re not so tough.

26
00:01:56.848 --> 00:01:59.198
Tina: We can fight you!

27
00:01:59.199 --> 00:02:03.565
Tristay: Oh, I think you’re too afraid.

28
00:02:03.566 --> 00:02:06.960
Danny: Well, we’re not!

29
00:02:06.961 --> 00:02:09.083
Brad: I am a little.

30
00:02:09.084 --> 00:02:10.592
Tina: Shh!

31
00:02:10.593 --> 00:02:14.533
Tristay: I’ve been watching you three for a while.

32
00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:18.161
Tristay: But there were four of you in the net.

33
00:02:18.162 --> 00:02:22.461
Who is the fourth?

34
00:02:22.462 --> 00:02:26.263
Bello: Hello!

35
00:02:26.264 --> 00:02:31.331
Tristay: Hopian’s son? How excellent!

36
00:02:31.332 --> 00:02:34.190
Danny: You’re not going to hurt him!

37
00:02:34.191 --> 00:02:38.980
Tristay: Oh, you are brave, young one.

38
00:02:38.981 --> 00:02:42.205
Danny: We’re so close to defeating you.

39
00:02:42.206 --> 00:02:47.029
Tristay: That’s right. You are very, very close.

40
00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.599
And how did you do it?

41
00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.248
Danny: I used my imagination.

42
00:02:52.249 --> 00:02:56.947
Tristay: Yes. But you used magic clay.

43
00:02:56.948 --> 00:03:02.616
And guess what I’m going to take?

44
00:03:02.617 --> 00:03:11.899
Danny: No!

45
00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:20.568
Tristay: Now, let me show you my favorite color─black!

46
00:03:20.569 --> 00:03:22.920
Brad: But black is not a color.

47
00:03:22.921 --> 00:03:26.148
It is what’s left when you remove color.

48
00:03:26.149 --> 00:03:30.892
Tristay: “Remove.” That’s a good word.

49
00:03:30.893 --> 00:03:35.073
I like to remove problems.

50
00:03:35.074 --> 00:03:44.227
Tristay: And you troublemakers are about to be removed for good!

51
00:03:44.228 --> 00:03:54.579
Tristay: Good-bye, children. Have a nice trip.

52
00:03:54.580 --> 00:04:01.020
All three: Noooooo!
